    "updated_at": "2026-02-06T10:48:37Z",
    "body": "This needs to be updated to account for https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7536166. In summary, a long press happens while the touch is still active (finger is on screen) and releasing (lifting finger) can trigger the \"when the user no longer designates an element element with a pointing device\" condition and lose interest again. Exact fix in spec language TBD.",
